# fact-graph/, form-builder/ and taxpert/ are deliberately NOT listed. All three live beside this
# repository rather than inside it (see README), and a clone that lands here anyway is the failure
# mode that cost us a day: a second form-builder republishes `gov.irs::form-builder` over the good
# one, and a second taxpert is a second packages/ui for copy-shared-ui to mirror. Left un-ignored,
# any of them shows up in `git status` instead of hiding.

# Generated mirrors of taxpert's packages/ui/src, written by `make copy-shared-ui` (a prerequisite of
# every build target here). Kept out of git so they can never drift from the taxpert source they
# mirror; `make check-shared-ui` fails the build if they do.
#
# Matched by shape rather than named per application, so an application added to this repository is
# covered without an edit here — the same reason the root Makefile discovers its APPS.
**/website-static/vendor/taxpert/

# Scala.js sourcemaps vendored by `make copy-fg`
**/vendor/fact-graph/*.map

